("dry_throat_resolved", "The dry throat feels normal after drinking water. The person is awake, breathing and swallowing normally, with no pain or injury.", "Normal na ang tuyong lalamunan matapos uminom. Gising ang tao, normal huminga at lumunok, at walang sakit o pinsala.", "Normal na ang uga nga tutunlan human miinom og tubig. Mata ang tawo, normal moginhawa ug motulon, walay sakit o samad.", "Normal na ang dry throat after water. Awake ang person, normal breathing ug swallowing, no pain or injury."),
("warm_feeling_resolved", "Feeling warm has settled after resting in shade. The person is alert, comfortable, breathing normally, and reports no illness, pain, or injury.", "Nawala ang init ng pakiramdam matapos magpahinga sa lilim. Gising, komportable at normal huminga ang tao; walang sakit o pinsala.", "Nawala ang init nga paminaw human mipahulay sa landong. Mata, komportable ug normal moginhawa ang tawo; walay sakit o samad.", "Settled na ang warm feeling after shade. Alert ug comfortable ang person, normal breathing, no illness, pain or injury."),
("muscle_tiredness_resolved", "Brief muscle tiredness is gone after rest. The person walks comfortably, is fully awake, breathes normally, and reports no pain or injury.", "Nawala ang saglit na pagod ng kalamnan matapos magpahinga. Komportableng lumalakad, gising at normal huminga ang tao; walang sakit o pinsala.", "Nawala ang kadiyot nga kakapoy sa kaunoran human mipahulay. Komportable molakaw, mata ug normal moginhawa ang tawo; walay sakit o samad.", "Gone na ang brief muscle tiredness after rest. Comfortable mo-walk, fully awake ug normal breathing siya; no pain or injury."),
